    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on levin-2015-girardia-11: partially-resolvable, resolvability 0.66";
    dc:description "The experimental contrast is direct and can be audited to a limited extent from published results. Its mechanistic interpretation remains incomplete because one negative alcohol control cannot isolate gap-junction blockade.";
    dc:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/dataset-resolvability-0.2.0>;
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Compare blinded altered-head incidence after matched hexanol, octanol, and water exposures, including survival and developmental timing. A null hexanol effect alongside a reproducible octanol effect supports but does not prove gap-junction specificity.";
