    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Hexanol is an imperfect control for all octanol off-target effects.", "Underlying per-worm control data are not clearly deposited.";
